  "details": "GStreamer is a streaming media framework based on graphs of filters which operate on media data. The gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free package contains a collection of plug-ins for GStreamer.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gstreamer: gstreamer: rfbsrc/librfb Hextile heap out-of-bounds write with 16bpp framebuffer (CVE-2026-59691)\n  * gstreamer: gstreamer: DTLS certificate Subject DN stack buffer overflow in openssl_verify_callback (CVE-2026-59692)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
